# Gli Attomatti — Cursor Rules
# See AGENTS.md for full architecture, design system, and CMS details.

- Language: Italian ONLY for all user-facing text and copy.
- Always ignore the TODO file.
- Do not remove or modify the /Saalvermietung redirect in next.config.ts.
- Zero external database: content is in src/data/content.json.
- Always guard Next.js <Link> against undefined or empty href.
- Always guard Next.js <Image> against empty string src by providing a fallback image.
- Never hardcode arbitrary hex colors; use CSS variables and Tailwind tokens defined in src/app/globals.css.
- Mandatory legal audit: on every feature/change (third-party tools, embeds, forms, cookies, pricing, or registration flows), always verify and update legal documents (Privacy, Termini, Impressum, CookieBanner) in compliant Italian.
